{"server":"jp","storyId":"main_4_level_main_04-06_end","groupId":"main_4","stageId":"main_04-06","title":"見聞少なく怪多し","storyCode":"4-6","avgTag":"戦闘後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-06_end.txt","sourceHash":"2b39da97288f24441d545940d46fbd28228029b09d4602425bddd53ec6b38f5c","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三十二关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"これで、周囲のレユニオンは制圧できましたね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"やれやれ……単なる足止めにしては、やり過ぎなくらいの相手でしたよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"さて、チェン隊長のほうは……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"影も形もありませんね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"これは、まずいですね……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"通信にも……応答しない、と。相変わらず、困ったお人だ！　かくなる上は……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"近衛局各員に告ぐ！　突入するぞ、準備を――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ホシグマさん、待ってください。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ここは私たちに任せてもらえませんか。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ご承知の通り、この先の道は、天災によって発生した源石の群生地帯になっています。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"健康体の方があまり深くまで進んでしまうと、鉱石病への感染リスクは免れません。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ともすれば、深刻な結果に繋がりかねないということです。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"それに、感染者の私たちであれば――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"――アーミヤさんが懸命に話すご様子は、実に健気で可愛らしい。何やら、心を打たれるものがありますね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"わわ、え、ええっと……！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"はははっ、失礼。今のは忘れてください。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"それより、小官を説得しようとお思いのようですが、その必要はありません。あなたの仰りたいことはわかっていますから。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"――近衛局各員、聞け！　方針変更だ！　我々はこれより、ロドスの背中を預かる盾としてこの任務に当たることとする！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"レユニオンの出入りを許さぬよう、街の入り口を守るんだ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者の問題は、その専門家に任せるとしよう！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ホシグマさん……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"ああ、そうそう。私のことは気軽に「ホシグマ」と呼んでいただいて結構ですので。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"――チェン隊長のこと、よろしくお願いします。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"あの人に死んでもらっては困りますから。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"わかりました、ホシグマ……さん！　必ず、チェン隊長を無事に連れ帰ってきますので！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"ええ。あなた方も、どうかお気をつけて。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"はい！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ドクター、ついてきてください。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ロドスのみなさんも、準備はいいですか？　――それでは、出発しましょう！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（待っていてください、チェンさん……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（それに、フロストリーフさん、メテオリーテさん、ジェシカさんも……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（どうか、持ちこたえて……！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"これで、救援可能な範囲の偵察隊は全員、撤退が完了しました！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"ですが……状況は、芳しくありません……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケルシー","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケルシー","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"皮膚は赤く、腫れも見られる……全身の体温が低下し、組織の壊死まで起こっているようだが……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケルシー","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"考えられる原因は――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重傷のオペレーター","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……っう、ぐ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケルシー","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"凍傷、か？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["アーミヤ"]},{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["ケルシー"]},{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["医療オペレーター"]},{"speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","aliases":["ホシグマ"]}]}
